{"ts":"2026-07-11T13:40:13.069Z","author":"codex","op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-11T13:40:13.069Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-11T13:40:13.068Z","author":"codex","text":"Implemented optional provider-neutral OIDC Authorization Code + PKCE S256 login. Environment contract: OIDC_ISSUER, OIDC_CLIENT_ID, OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET, OIDC_REDIRECT_URI, optional OIDC_SCOPES (default openid profile email), dedicated OIDC_COOKIE_SECRET, and optional OIDC_REQUIRE_VERIFIED_EMAIL. OIDC remains disabled with no variables and partial production configuration stops startup."}]}],"before_hash":"4fe519ff73c73f12c309339189cae5e9540abcf14e7cecd9132b19bd333e355c","after_hash":"2021f53e6fc148be9c01d571b7ce61d38efe51ae1ede67b42dca6092dcfe0811"}
{"ts":"2026-07-11T13:40:13.603Z","author":"codex","op":"learning_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-11T13:40:13.603Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/learnings","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-11T13:40:13.602Z","author":"codex","text":"Use immutable issuer+subject as the external identity key. Email may link an existing account only when email_verified is the boolean true; unverified collisions must be rejected. Provider discovery/JWKS and code-grant validation stay in openid-client, with explicit defense-in-depth issuer, audience, nonce, and time checks."}]}],"before_hash":"2021f53e6fc148be9c01d571b7ce61d38efe51ae1ede67b42dca6092dcfe0811","after_hash":"5e6df91d5d1f0a43dc0c687465bc58efbb486c1e7c6f47dcbcbb044a532a183c"}
